#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:1
msgid "故障排查"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:3
msgid "排查原则"
msgstr "Investigation Principles"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:6
msgid ""
"本页按**可观察现象**组织 HM-D20、HM-D13 和 HM-G51B 的常见问题。开始前先记录完"
"整产品型号、出厂固件、连接方式和差分链路；**每次只验证一项变量**，避免在信息"
"不完整时同时修改多项配置。"
msgstr ""
"This page organizes common HM-D20, HM-D13, and HM-G51B issues by "
"**observable symptom**. Before troubleshooting, record the full model, "
"factory firmware, connection method, and correction link. **Change and "
"verify one variable at a time.**"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:9
msgid "无法上电或反复重启"
msgstr "Cannot power on or keeps restarting"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:12
msgid ""
"D20 误接线可能已经造成硬件损坏 D20 只能使用 5 V ±0.5 V 供电。立即断电并核对"
"[完整 8-pin 线束定义](../operation/d20-wiring.md)：不得反接正负极，不得使用错"
"误电压，不得将电源正极连接到 TX、RX 或其他信号线。纠正接线后仍无法上电时，请"
"停止反复通电并联系技术支持。"
msgstr ""
"D20 incorrect wiring may have caused hardware damage. D20 can only be "
"powered with 5 V ±0.5 V. Immediately cut off the power and check the "
"[complete 8-pin wiring definition](../operation/d20-wiring.md): do not "
"reverse the polarity, do not use the wrong voltage, and do not connect the "
"power positive to TX, RX, or other signal lines. If it still cannot power on "
"after correcting the wiring, stop repeatedly turning on the power and "
"contact technical support."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**供电与极性**：D20/D13 供电应为 5 V ±0.5 V，并确认正负极连接正确。"
msgstr ""
"**Power Supply and Polarity**: The D20/D13 power supply should be 5 V ±0.5 "
"V, and ensure that the positive and negative connections are correct."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**线缆与连接器**：检查是否松动或接触不良。"
msgstr "**Cables and Connectors**: Check for looseness or poor contact."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**外部负载**：断开非必需外设后重新上电，排除外部接线短路或负载异常。"
msgstr ""
"**External Load**: Power on again after disconnecting non-essential "
"peripherals to rule out external wiring short circuits or abnormal loads."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:18
msgid ""
"**主控端口供电**：若由飞控或主控供电，确认端口能够稳定供电；无法确认时使用独"
"立合规电源测试。"
msgstr ""
"**Main Control Port Power Supply**: If powered by the flight controller or "
"main control unit, ensure the port can supply stable power; if it cannot be "
"confirmed, use an independent compliant power source for testing."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:20
msgid "串口不存在或没有数据"
msgstr "The serial port does not exist or has no data"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:22
msgid ""
"**UART 电平**：D20/D13 的 UART I/O 电平为 3.3 V；使用标配 USB 转 UART 转接"
"器，或确认目标设备串口兼容该电平。"
msgstr ""
"**UART level**: The D20/D13 UART I/O level is 3.3 V. Use the supplied USB-to-"
"UART adapter, or verify that the target-device serial port supports this "
"logic level."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:23
msgid ""
"**设备节点**：使用标配转接器时，确认系统已识别该设备，可通过 `ls /dev/"
"ttyUSB*` 查看。"
msgstr ""
"**Device node**: When using the supplied adapter, confirm that the system "
"recognizes it with `ls /dev/ttyUSB*`."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:24
msgid "**串口参数**：确认波特率为 `115200`，TX/RX 已交叉连接，GND 已共地。"
msgstr ""
"**Serial Port Parameters**: Confirm the baud rate is `115200`, TX/RX are "
"cross-connected, and GND is common."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:25
msgid ""
"**端口占用与权限**：确认串口未被其他程序占用，当前用户具有串口访问权限。"
msgstr ""
"**Port Usage and Permissions**: Make sure the serial port is not occupied by "
"other programs and that the current user has access permissions to the "
"serial port."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:26
msgid ""
"**输出协议**：确认当前输出与目标设备一致，具体选择见[固件与输出协议选择](../"
"operation/firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Output protocol**: Verify that the current output matches the target "
"device; see [Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol](../operation/firmware-"
"output.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:28
msgid "完整接线和串口检查见[设备连接与状态验证](../operation/index.rst)。"
msgstr ""
"For complete wiring and serial port checks, see [Device Connection and "
"Status Verification](../operation/index.rst)."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:30
msgid "有串口数据但没有卫星定位"
msgstr "There is serial port data but no satellite positioning"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:32
msgid ""
"**测试位置**：将设备移到天空视野开阔的位置，避开室内、金属遮挡、高楼和树木。"
msgstr ""
"**Test Location**: Move the device to a location with an open view of the "
"sky, away from indoors, metal obstructions, tall buildings, and trees."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:33
msgid "**天线遮挡**：检查 GNSS 天线区域是否被平台结构或其他设备遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"**Antenna Obstruction**: Check whether the GNSS antenna area is blocked by "
"the platform structure or other equipment."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:34
msgid "**卫星状态**：确认卫星数和信号强度是否持续更新。"
msgstr ""
"**Satellite Status**: Confirm whether the number of satellites and signal "
"strength are continuously updating."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:35
msgid "**原始记录**：保存串口数据，并记录测试地点、时间和安装方式。"
msgstr ""
"**Original Record**: Save serial port data and record the test location, "
"time, and installation method."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:37
msgid "4G 版本无法获取差分数据"
msgstr "The 4G version cannot obtain correction data"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:39
msgid ""
"**SIM 与网络**：确认 SIM 卡已开通数据流量，设备所在位置具有蜂窝网络覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"**SIM and Network**: Confirm that the SIM card has activated data services, "
"and that the device is in an area with cellular network coverage."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:40
msgid ""
"**4G 天线**：HM-D20-4G 应确认外置 4G 天线安装牢靠；HM-D13-4G 的 4G 天线内置。"
msgstr ""
"**4G Antenna**: The HM-D20-4G should ensure that the external 4G antenna is "
"securely installed; the 4G antenna of the HM-D13-4G is built-in."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:41
msgid ""
"**账号配置**：使用 JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2 检查服务器地址、端口、挂载点、用"
"户名和密码。"
msgstr ""
"**Account Configuration**: Use JR_NTRIP_Config_Tool_V1.2 to check the server "
"address, port, mount point, username, and password."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:42
msgid "**CORS 服务**：确认 CORS/NTRIP 当前可用，账号未过期且挂载点正确。"
msgstr ""
"**CORS Service**: Confirm that CORS/NTRIP is currently available, the "
"account has not expired, and the mount point is correct."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:43
msgid "**重新验证**：在开阔环境重新上电，观察是否能够获得差分数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Re-verify**: Power on again in an open environment and observe whether "
"correction data can be obtained."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:45
msgid "LoRa 基站与移动站无法连接"
msgstr "LoRa base station cannot connect with rover"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:47
msgid ""
"**套件配对**：确认使用套件内的专用 D13 LoRa 基站硬件，基站和移动站为出厂配对"
"组合。"
msgstr ""
"**Kit Pairing**: Confirm that the dedicated D13 LoRa base station hardware "
"within the kit is used; the base station and rover are paired by the "
"manufacturer."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:48
msgid "**供电与天线**：确认基站和移动站均已上电，所需 LoRa 天线已正确安装。"
msgstr ""
"**Power Supply and Antenna**: Ensure that both the base station and the "
"rover are powered on, and that the required LoRa antenna is properly "
"installed."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:49
msgid "**基站数量**：同一局部场景只开启一个基站，不要同时运行多个基站。"
msgstr ""
"**Number of base stations**: Only one base station should be activated in "
"the same local operating area; do not operate multiple base stations "
"simultaneously."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:50
msgid "**链路视距**：减少基站和移动站之间的遮挡，并优先保持视距。"
msgstr ""
"**Link Line-of-Sight**: Reduce obstructions between the base station and the "
"rover, and prioritize maintaining line-of-sight."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:51
msgid ""
"**配套关系变化**：记录全部产品型号和序列信息后联系技术支持，不要自行修改配对"
"参数。"
msgstr ""
"**Changes in Matching Relationships**: After recording all product models "
"and serial information, contact technical support. Do not modify pairing "
"parameters on your own."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:53
msgid "长时间停留在单点解或浮点解"
msgstr "Long-term stay in single-point solution or float solution"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:55
msgid "**天空视野**：确认移动站具有开阔天空视野，卫星数和信号质量正常。"
msgstr ""
"**Sky View**: Ensure that the rover has an unobstructed view of the sky, "
"with the number of satellites and signal quality being normal."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:56
msgid ""
"**差分链路**：4G 版本检查 SIM、网络和 CORS/NTRIP 配置；LoRa 版本检查基站供"
"电、天线、遮挡和配套关系。"
msgstr ""
"**Correction Link**: The 4G version checks the SIM, network, and CORS/NTRIP "
"configuration; the LoRa version checks the base station power supply, "
"antenna, obstructions, and supporting relationships."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:57
msgid "**基站状态**：确认专用 D13 LoRa 基站已稳定架设，上电后没有被移动。"
msgstr ""
"**Base station status**: Confirm that the dedicated D13 LoRa base station "
"has been stably set up and has not been moved after being powered on."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:58
msgid "**现场环境**：排除建筑、树木、金属结构和强电磁干扰造成的遮挡或多路径。"
msgstr ""
"**On-site environment**: Exclude obstructions or multipath caused by "
"buildings, trees, metal structures, and strong electromagnetic interference."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:60
msgid ""
"状态判断顺序见[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)。"
msgstr ""
"The sequence of state judgments can be found in [RTK State and Fixed "
"Solution Validation](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:62
msgid "固定解频繁丢失或位置跳变"
msgstr "Frequent loss of fixed solutions or sudden position jumps"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:64
msgid "**卫星环境**：检查天空视野、卫星信号和现场多路径环境。"
msgstr ""
"**Satellite Environment**: Check the sky view, satellite signals, and on-"
"site multipath environment."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:65
msgid ""
"**差分链路变化**：检查 4G/CORS 网络与账号，或 LoRa 基站供电、天线和现场遮挡是"
"否发生变化。"
msgstr ""
"**Correction Link Changes**: Check whether the 4G/CORS network and accounts, "
"or LoRa base station power supply, antennas, and on-site obstructions have "
"changed."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:66
msgid "**供电与连接**：检查电源和线缆是否稳定，天线连接是否松动。"
msgstr ""
"**Power Supply and Connections**: Check whether the power and cables are "
"stable, and whether the antenna connection is loose."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:67
msgid "**LoRa 基站**：确认基站没有移动，基站与移动站之间无遮挡或弱遮挡。"
msgstr ""
"**LoRa base station**: Ensure that the base station has not moved, and that "
"there is no obstruction or only weak obstruction between the base station "
"and the rover."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:68
msgid "**连续日志**：保存异常前后的连续串口日志，避免只截取单帧数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Continuous Logs**: Save the continuous serial port logs before and after "
"the exception to avoid capturing only a single frame of data."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:70
msgid "ArduPilot 或 PX4 无法识别设备"
msgstr "ArduPilot or PX4 cannot recognize the device"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:72
msgid ""
"**设备输出**：根据飞控要求确认设备已配置 UBX 输出，默认波特率为 115200 bps。"
msgstr ""
"**Device Output**: Confirm that the device is configured for UBX output "
"according to the flight controller requirements, with the default baud rate "
"of 115200 bps."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:73
msgid "**飞控端口**：确认实际连接端口已配置为 GPS/UBX 输入。"
msgstr ""
"**Flight Control Port**: Confirm that the actual connected port is "
"configured as GPS/UBX input."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:74
msgid ""
"**电平与接线**：确认飞控 UART 与 D20 的 3.3 V I/O 电平兼容，TX/RX 已交叉连接"
"并共地。"
msgstr ""
"**Level and Wiring**: Confirm that the flight controller UART is compatible "
"with the D20's 3.3 V I/O level, and that TX/RX are cross-connected with a "
"common ground."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:75
msgid ""
"**数据接收**：先确认飞控能够持续收到数据，再检查地面站中的 GPS 和 RTK 状态。"
msgstr ""
"**Data Reception**: First confirm that the flight controller can "
"continuously receive data, then check the GPS and RTK status in the ground "
"station."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:76
msgid "**协议不一致**：按目标输出协议重新确认交付固件。"
msgstr ""
"**Protocol Inconsistency**: Reconfirm the delivered firmware according to "
"the target output protocol."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:78
msgid "Viobot2 无法接收到 RTK 数据"
msgstr "Viobot2 cannot receive RTK data"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:80
msgid "**D20 输出**：先在 PC 上确认使用地面版固件，并有 NMEA 输出。"
msgstr ""
"**D20 Output**: First, confirm on the PC that the ground firmware is being "
"used and that there is NMEA output."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:81
msgid "**驱动串口**：确认 RTK 驱动中的串口号与实际设备节点一致。"
msgstr ""
"**Driver Serial Port**: Confirm that the serial port number in the RTK "
"driver matches the actual device node."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:82
msgid "**NMEA 消息**：确认 D20 输出 GGA 和 RMC。"
msgstr "**NMEA Message**: Confirm that D20 outputs GGA and RMC."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:83
msgid "**Viobot2 设置**：确认上位机中已勾选 RTK 并重启设备。"
msgstr ""
"**Viobot2 Settings**: Make sure RTK is checked in the host PC and restart "
"the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:84
msgid "**驱动话题**：通过 `rostopic echo /rtk_nmea` 确认驱动输出。"
msgstr ""
"**Driver Topic**: Confirm driver output through `rostopic echo /rtk_nmea`."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:85
msgid ""
"**解析结果**：通过 `rostopic echo /baton/rtk` 确认 Viobot2 已解析 RTK 数据。"
msgstr ""
"**Analysis Result**: Confirmed that Viobot2 has parsed RTK data through "
"`rostopic echo /baton/rtk`."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:87
msgid "固件升级失败或升级后输出异常"
msgstr "Firmware upgrade failed or abnormal output after upgrade"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:89
msgid "**升级供电**：确认过程中供电稳定，串口和数据线未断开。"
msgstr ""
"**Upgrade Power Supply**: Ensure that the power supply is stable during the "
"process, and that the serial port and data cable are not disconnected."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:90
msgid ""
"**固件选择**：确认固件对应当前产品和目标输出协议，具体选择见[固件与输出协议选"
"择](../operation/firmware-output.md)。"
msgstr ""
"**Firmware selection**: Verify that the firmware matches the product and "
"target output protocol; see [Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol](../"
"operation/firmware-output.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:91
msgid ""
"**升级后验收**：重新连接设备，检查卫星信息和输出协议；RTK 产品还应在开阔环境"
"确认能否进入固定解。"
msgstr ""
"**Post-Upgrade Acceptance**: Reconnect the device, check the satellite "
"information and output protocol; RTK products should also be tested in an "
"open environment to confirm whether they can achieve a fixed solution."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:92
msgid ""
"**异常处理**：若工具报错、设备无法启动或输出与预期不符，保留工具日志和固件信"
"息，不要连续尝试不同固件。"
msgstr ""
"**Exception Handling**: If the tool reports an error, the device fails to "
"start, or the output does not match expectations, retain the tool logs and "
"firmware information, and do not repeatedly attempt different firmware."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:94
msgid "具体流程见[固件升级](../maintenance/firmware-update.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Firmware Upgrade](../maintenance/firmware-update.md) for the detailed "
"process."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:96
msgid "G51B 无法定位或没有输出"
msgstr "G51B cannot be located or has no output"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:98
msgid "**供电**：确认满足 4.0–5.5 V，极性和共地正确。"
msgstr ""
"**Power Supply**: Confirm it meets 4.0–5.5 V, with correct polarity and "
"common ground."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:99
msgid "**UART 接口**：按交付资料确认 TX/RX、电平和默认 115200 bps 波特率。"
msgstr ""
"**UART Interface**: Confirm TX/RX, voltage level, and the default 115200 bps "
"baud rate according to the delivery documents."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:100
msgid "**数据输出**：确认主机能够接收 UBX-NAV-PVT 数据。"
msgstr "**Data Output**: Confirm that the host can receive UBX-NAV-PVT data."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:101
msgid "**安装位置**：将天线布置在天空视野开阔的位置，避开金属遮挡和强干扰源。"
msgstr ""
"**Installation Location**: Place the antenna in a location with an open view "
"of the sky, avoiding metal obstructions and strong sources of interference."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:103
msgid "联系技术支持前准备"
msgstr "Preparation Before Contacting Technical Support"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:105
msgid ""
"请尽量同时提供以下信息，便于区分供电、接口、固件、差分链路和现场环境问题："
msgstr ""
"Provide the following information simultaneously to facilitate the "
"distinction between power supply, interfaces, firmware, correction links, "
"and on-site environmental issues:"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:107
msgid "建议一次性提供"
msgstr "It is recommended to provide all at once"

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:110
msgid "**设备信息**：完整产品型号、硬件版本和固件版本。"
msgstr ""
"**Device Information**: Complete product model, hardware version, and "
"firmware version."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:111
msgid "**电气与串口**：供电方式、实测电压、UART 连接方式和波特率。"
msgstr ""
"**Electrical and Serial Port**: Power supply method, measured voltage, UART "
"connection method, and baud rate."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:112
msgid "**差分链路**：4G/CORS 或 LoRa 套件组成与连接方式。"
msgstr ""
"**Correction Link**: Composition and connection methods of 4G/CORS or LoRa "
"kits."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:113
msgid "**现场照片**：设备、天线、基站和周边环境。"
msgstr ""
"**On-site Photos**: Equipment, antennas, base stations, and surrounding "
"environment."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:114
msgid "**运行证据**：连续原始串口日志，以及配置工具或地面站截图。"
msgstr ""
"**Operational Evidence**: Continuous original serial port logs, as well as "
"screenshots from the configuration tool or ground station."

#: ../../source/rtk/troubleshooting/troubleshooting.md:115
msgid "**复现条件**：测试地点、时间、持续时长和问题复现步骤。"
msgstr ""
"**Reproduction Conditions**: Test location, time, duration, and steps to "
"reproduce the issue."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**输出协议**：确认当前固件与预期输出一致。D20 地面版默认 NMEA、无人机版默"
#~ "认 UBX；D13 仅提供地面版，默认 NMEA，也可按需求配置为 UBX。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output Protocol**: Confirm that the current firmware matches the "
#~ "expected output. The D20 ground firmware defaults to NMEA, and the UAV "
#~ "firmware defaults to UBX; the D13 only offers a ground firmware, "
#~ "defaulting to NMEA, but can also be configured to UBX as needed."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**固件选择**：确认固件对应当前产品和目标输出协议。D20 地面版默认 NMEA、无"
#~ "人机版默认 UBX；D13 仅提供地面版，默认 NMEA，也可按需求配置为 UBX。实际输"
#~ "出以交付配置为准。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Firmware Selection**: Confirm that the firmware corresponds to the "
#~ "current product and the target output protocol. The D20 Ground Edition "
#~ "defaults to NMEA, while the Drone Edition defaults to UBX; the D13 only "
#~ "provides a Ground Edition, defaulting to NMEA, but can also be configured "
#~ "to UBX as needed. The actual output is subject to the delivered "
#~ "configuration."
